    q0: 'What is the Nusuk competition?', a0: '<p>The Ministry of Hajj and Umrah launched a new challenge on the Nusuk platform that gives participants the chance to win 100 free Umrah trips for two (the winner and a companion of their choice), plus 10,000 cartons of blessed Zamzam water.</p><p><b>How to join the competition:</b></p><ul><li><b>Get the app:</b> open the Nusuk app on your phone and register your details.</li><li><b>Enter the challenge:</b> go to the services menu, choose «Discover the challenge» and accept the terms and conditions.</li><li><b>Daily keys:</b> you get one key every day to start answering the questions.</li><li><b>More chances:</b> share the app link or your code with friends and family to get extra keys that raise your chances in the draw.</li><li><b>Answer:</b> pick one of the four doors and answer the questions (about the Holy Quran, the Prophet\'s biography, Madinah and the Prophet\'s Mosque).</li><li><b>The draw:</b> a correct answer enters you into the prize draw.</li></ul>',
    q1: 'What are Nusuk referral codes?', a1: 'Codes that start with <bdi>NG-</bdi> followed by 8 letters and digits; every participant in the Nusuk challenge has one. This page gathers people\'s codes in one place, and every code you verify in Nusuk adds a key for you.',
    q2: 'How do I use a Nusuk app code?', a2: 'Open the Nusuk app first and leave it open, then come back here and tap «Open a new code». It takes you to Nusuk with the code filled in; tap «Verify code». Then come back and open another new code.',
