    q4: 'How does the Nusuk challenge code exchange work here?', a4: 'Everyone adds their code, and codes are also collected automatically every day. The «Open a new code» button opens a code you haven\'t opened before each time. The page is free, with no account or sign-up.',
    q5: 'Why do some Nusuk key codes not work?', a5: 'A code may have been typed wrong or may no longer be available, and this page can\'t check every code inside Nusuk. If you get an error, don\'t worry: come back here and open a new code.',
    q6: 'What are the Nusuk competition prizes?', a6: 'According to the challenge announcements: 100 free Umrah trips for two people and 10,000 cartons of Zamzam water. The official terms and details are in the Nusuk app, and codes alone don\'t guarantee winning.',
    q7: 'How do I add my code to the list?', a7: 'Tap «Add your code» above and paste the code or its link, or even whole comments that contain codes. Only the codes are kept, and duplicates aren\'t added again.',
    q8: 'Is this page affiliated with the Nusuk app?', a8: 'No. This is an independent personal initiative, not affiliated with the Nusuk app, the Ministry of Hajj and Umrah, or any official body.',
